dexlib
======

The legacy Android dexer, com.android.dx, taken unmodified from the dexlib
module of J2ME Loader (https://github.com/nikita36078/J2ME-Loader), which in
turn packages the dx tool from the Android Open Source Project.

Copyright (C) The Android Open Source Project
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

It runs on the device: the IDE compiles a midlet to java class files, this
converts them to a dex, and the embedded runtime loads that dex.
